{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Story]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is the National Museum of Korea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For unknown reasons, cultural artifacts have vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play a matching game featuring beautiful Korean patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Successfully complete the game to find the 100 lost relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can acquire cultural artifacts actually displayed in the museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[How to Play]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Select the cultural artifact you wish to acquire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/08c76dd746f419ed6a430952632c33a9.poster.avif?t=1758507810\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/08c76dd746f419ed6a430952632c33a9.webm?t=1758507810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/08c76dd746f419ed6a430952632c33a9.mp4?t=1758507810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Match the patterns within the allotted time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/f68d29f4050c3e1ba58e63d84980e015.poster.avif?t=1758507810\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/f68d29f4050c3e1ba58e63d84980e015.webm?t=1758507810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/f68d29f4050c3e1ba58e63d84980e015.mp4?t=1758507810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Successfully complete the game to acquire the artifact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/3afe982efb8830bc98ea7ef9c0ac2bd3.poster.avif?t=1758507810\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/3afe982efb8830bc98ea7ef9c0ac2bd3.webm?t=1758507810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/3afe982efb8830bc98ea7ef9c0ac2bd3.mp4?t=1758507810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. View descriptions of the artifacts in 16 languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/d9b787891543ba6b8c79e027210bf052.poster.avif?t=1758507810\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/d9b787891543ba6b8c79e027210bf052.webm?t=1758507810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018050/extras/d9b787891543ba6b8c79e027210bf052.mp4?t=1758507810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Tip]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an infinite exhibition where beautiful traditional music and cultural artifacts can purify your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop p